# LF everywhere. This repo runs on Linux only — prod is a Linux host, CI is a
# Linux runner, and every developer checkout is Linux.
#
# Mixed endings cost real time before this file existed: a scripted edit that
# writes text rather than bytes silently rewrites a CRLF file to LF, so a
# two-line change lands as a whole-file diff and buries the actual change.
# It happened twice in one day (cache.py, then six frontend files).
# `text=auto eol=lf` makes git normalise on the way in, so the working tree and
# the index agree no matter what wrote the file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
